# #5833, C2. The arm re-claims the deferred generation but records no close head: the
# stale donor's write admitted under the old generation before the re-claim lies above
# the receiver's read position and is passed. It edits an operator, not an action.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestReceiverArmBelowDeferredReclaimHead
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the arm re-claims but records no close head
BOUNDS: WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 0, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ hoClosedAt' = Max2(hoClosedAt, next)
    /\ UNCHANGED <<gD, pendGen
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no close head.
    /\ UNCHANGED hoClosedAt
    /\ UNCHANGED <<gD, pendGen
--- END
